{"id":434010,"title":"Show some hour numbers in analog clock SVG","line":"The Breeze analog clock now shows the numbers 3, 6 and 9 alongside the 12.","kind":"wish","status":"fixed","repos":["libplasma"],"date":"2026-11-26","explanation":"The analog clock's face comes from the Plasma theme's widgets/clock.svg. Breeze's face had an accent-colored \"12\" at the top but only plain accent bars at 3, 6 and 9, so there was no way to see more hour numbers. The change replaces those three bars (and their shadows) with \"3\", \"6\" and \"9\" drawn from the same Oxygen glyphs, size, accent color and drop shadow as the 12, placed at the same distance from the edge, and removes the minute marks next to them the same way the face already leaves them out around the 12.","commits":[{"repo":"libplasma","message":"breeze/clock: show 3, 6 and 9 as numbers like the 12\n\nThe Breeze analog clock only had a number at 12, with plain bars at 3, 6\nand 9. Draw those three as numbers in the same style and color as the\n12, and leave out the minute marks next to them as is done around 12.\n\nBUG: 434010"}],"patches":[{"repo":"libplasma","diff":"diff --git a/src/desktoptheme/breeze/widgets/clock.svg b/src/desktoptheme/breeze/widgets/clock.svg\nindex 330dcd2a9..9d6af080f 100644\n--- a/src/desktoptheme/breeze/widgets/clock.svg\n+++ b/src/desktoptheme/breeze/widgets/clock.svg\n@@ -287,45 +287,6 @@\n          stdDeviation=\"0.87589417\"\n          id=\"feGaussianBlur5360-0\" />\n     </filter>\n-    <filter\n-       color-interpolation-filters=\"sRGB\"\n-       inkscape:collect=\"always\"\n-       id=\"filter5590\"\n-       x=\"-0.061314348\"\n-       width=\"1.1226287\"\n-       y=\"-0.4526684\"\n-       height=\"1.9053369\">\n-      <feGaussianBlur\n-         inkscape:collect=\"always\"\n-         stdDeviation=\"0.51095291\"\n-         id=\"feGaussianBlur5592\" />\n-    </filter>\n-    <filter\n-       color-interpolation-filters=\"sRGB\"\n-       inkscape:collect=\"always\"\n-       id=\"filter